 "text": "Hi, how have you been? You can use it for washing up or washing the dishes from the day. Which is more sustainable? Using little water per wash. eco soap and turn the tap off between sprays. Use a bowl instead of at sink, it saves water. Bury them with the bottom side above soil line, so they don't odorise. Or wrap and put them in your fridge. Basically, use as little water as possible. Use the tap only to fill, not to wash off oil. Use a bowl instead of at the sink. Bury scraps properly. You' get the hang of it.",
